                {workspace,drive,managed-graph-dry-run,graph-dry-run,init,improve-bind,improve-complete,next,status,report,plan-status,context,complete,done,verify,planning-verify,planning-upgrade,history,journal,halt,pause,resume,repair,merge-recover,replan,revisit,migrate} ...

Markdown-authoritative, action-oriented session harness

positional arguments:
  {workspace,drive,managed-graph-dry-run,graph-dry-run,init,improve-bind,improve-complete,next,status,report,plan-status,context,complete,done,verify,planning-verify,planning-upgrade,history,journal,halt,pause,resume,repair,merge-recover,replan,revisit,migrate}
